r^{\alpha-\frac{\delta+\nu'-\beta}{\delta}-\frac{1}{2\delta}}}{i^{\alpha} r^{2\alpha} - 2r^\alpha \cos(\alpha \pi) + {(-i)}^{\alpha}}dr\left\|f(s,\cdot)\right\|_{L^{2}_{x}}ds\right\|_{L^{2}_{T}}\\
