    \caption{\label{fig:kernels} Projection kernels for the galaxy overdensity (solid) and CMB lensing (dashed, rescaled to match the amplitude of the galaxy kernels). The solid, dark blue curve shows the lump-sum of all the galaxies into a single bin, while the solid black curve shows the kernel for the optimal combination of bins at $\ell=500$, computed following equation~\eqref{combine_weights}.}
