 $v(t)$ & $\left(\frac{F_0}{m}\right) t$ & $\sqrt{\frac{2P}{m}} \, t^{1/2}$  \\  \hline
 $x(t)$ & $\frac{1}{2}\left(\frac{F_0}{m}\right) t^2$ & $\sqrt{\frac{8P}{9m}}\, t^{3/2}$ \\ \hline
