\caption{{\bf{\sffamily{Discovered constitutive model for left atrial tissue.}}} Piola stresses $P$ as functions of stretches $\lambda$ of the constitutive neural network from Fig. \ref{fig01}, trained with all 1:0.5, 1:0.75, 1:1, 0.75:1, and 0.5:1 (left-to-right columns) $t_2$:$t_1$ tension ratios experiments on the anterior left atrial tissue sample of patient A4 simultaneously. Each individual stretch-stress curve's $R^2$ goodness of fit with respect to the original experimental data is shown in the top left corner.}
\label{fig:LAantresults}
