            % \end{equation*}
            % Hence $X = 0$. In particular\footnote{We use the common abuse of notation of denoting also the composition $\cC \xto{\BLoc_{E}} \BLoc_{E} \cC \into \cC$ by $\BLoc_{E}$.} $\BLoc_{E}\BLoc_{F} \simeq \BLoc_{F} \BLoc_{E} \simeq 0$. 

            % The counit of the adjunction $c \colon LR \To \id$ at $(X,Y) \in \BLoc_E\cC \times \BLoc_F \cC$ is the isomorphism
